      "value": "Personally I think this is overkill and the binary toggle system works better. It would be a pain if I had to to determine where on a slider my avatar/world should be on that. A simple yes or no is easier and quicker and ease of use for a system like this is also very important.\n\nThat’s just my opinion though!",
