      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d0800ed67a32f0e119a70dd|full_name}: A binary system will NOT work for the massive beast of VRchat. \n\nThe Lack of Flexibility only allowing 2 options and is not enough for VRChat's WIDE and DIVERSE userbase\n\nInadequate Content Control where you either get \"baby mode\" or \"Raw uncut XXX\"\n\nPotential for Misunderstandings with people unable to instantly recognizing if content they see is properly filtered\n\nThe Difficulty in Moderation for more content slipping through the cracks, causing **more work** for the mod team.\n\nJust because it's binary doesn't mean it's the best.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
