      "value": "@{5e5619984444702227d7b0e1|full_name}: You either want to see something or not. You're not like \"mh maybe i want to see this idk\".\n\nA binary system is fine, it just needs more tags to have finer control over what themes they want to see, not more shades of \"Yes\" and \"No\"",
